    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32733" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπορνεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>commit fornication,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				38.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Jud.</u>
				7
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, in same sense, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.126
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., of
